# Seeded from apache/superset@ad1abef52ee4 (reviewed upstream)
msgid ""
"\n"
"                The cumulative option allows you to see how your data "
"accumulates over different\n"
"                values. When enabled, the histogram bars represent the "
"running total of frequencies\n"
"                up to each bin. This helps you understand how likely it "
"is to encounter values\n"
"                below a certain point. Keep in mind that enabling "
"cumulative doesn't change your\n"
"                original data, it just changes the way the histogram is "
"displayed."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"                Opcija kumulativno vam omogućava da vidite kako se vaši "
"podaci akumuliraju pri različitim\n"
"                vrednostima. Kada je omogućena, trake histograma "
"predstavljaju tekući zbir učestanosti\n"
"                do svakog bina. Ovo vam pomaže da razumete koliko je "
"verovatno da naiđete na vrednosti\n"
"                ispod određene tačke. Imajte na umu da omogućavanje "
"kumulativnog ne menja vaše\n"
"                izvorne podatke, samo menja način na koji se histogram "
"prikazuje."

# Seeded from apache/superset@ad1abef52ee4 (reviewed upstream)
msgid ""
"\n"
"                The normalize option transforms the histogram values into"
" proportions or\n"
"                probabilities by dividing each bin's count by the total "
"count of data points.\n"
"                This normalization process ensures that the resulting "
"values sum up to 1,\n"
"                enabling a relative comparison of the data's distribution"
" and providing a\n"
"                clearer understanding of the proportion of data points "
"within each bin."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"                Opcija normalizacije pretvara vrednosti histograma u "
"proporcije ili\n"
"                verovatnoće deljenjem broja u svakom binu ukupnim brojem "
"tačaka podataka.\n"
"                Ovaj proces normalizacije osigurava da zbir dobijenih "
"vrednosti bude 1,\n"
"                što omogućava relativno poređenje raspodele podataka i "
"pruža\n"
"                jasniju predstavu o udelu tačaka podataka u svakom binu."

