# Seeded from apache/superset@ad1abef52ee4 (reviewed upstream)
msgid ""
"Visualize a parallel set of metrics across multiple groups. Each group is"
" visualized using its own line of points and each metric is represented "
"as an edge in the chart."
msgstr ""
"Vizualizuje paralelan skup metrika kroz više grupa. Svaka grupa se "
"prikazuje sopstvenom linijom tačaka, a svaka metrika je predstavljena kao"
" ivica na grafikonu."

# Seeded from apache/superset@ad1abef52ee4 (reviewed upstream)
msgid ""
"Visualize a related metric across pairs of groups. Heatmaps excel at "
"showcasing the correlation or strength between two groups. Color is used "
"to emphasize the strength of the link between each pair of groups."
msgstr ""
"Vizualizuje povezanu metriku kroz parove grupa. Toplotne mape su posebno "
"dobre za prikazivanje korelacije ili snage veze između dve grupe. Boja se"
" koristi za naglašavanje snage veze između svakog para grupa."

# Seeded from apache/superset@ad1abef52ee4 (reviewed upstream)
msgid ""
"Visualize geospatial data like 3D buildings, landscapes, or objects in "
"grid view."
msgstr ""
"Vizualizuje geoprostorne podatke, kao što su 3D zgrade, pejzaži ili "
"objekti, u mrežnom prikazu."

# Seeded from apache/superset@ad1abef52ee4 (reviewed upstream)
msgid ""
"Visualize multiple levels of hierarchy using a familiar tree-like "
"structure."
msgstr "Vizualizuje više nivoa hijerarhije koristeći poznatu strukturu stabla."

# Seeded from apache/superset@ad1abef52ee4 (reviewed upstream)
msgid ""
"Visualize two different series using the same x-axis. Note that both "
"series can be visualized with a different chart type (e.g. 1 using bars "
"and 1 using a line)."
msgstr ""
"Vizualizuje dve različite serije koristeći istu x-osu. Imajte na umu da "
"obe serije mogu biti prikazane različitim tipom grafikona (npr. jedna "
"stubovima, a druga linijom)."

# Seeded from apache/superset@ad1abef52ee4 (reviewed upstream)
msgid ""
"Visualizes a metric across three dimensions of data in a single chart (X "
"axis, Y axis, and bubble size). Bubbles from the same group can be "
"showcased using bubble color."
msgstr ""
"Vizualizuje metriku kroz tri dimenzije podataka na jednom grafikonu (X "
"osa, Y osa i veličina balončića). Balončići iz iste grupe mogu se istaći "
"bojom balončića."

# Seeded from apache/superset@ad1abef52ee4 (reviewed upstream)
msgid "Visualizes connected points, which form a path, on a map."
msgstr "Vizualizuje povezane tačke, koje formiraju putanju, na mapi."

# Seeded from apache/superset@ad1abef52ee4 (reviewed upstream)
msgid ""
"Visualizes geographic areas from your data as polygons on a Mapbox "
"rendered map. Polygons can be colored using a metric."
msgstr ""
"Vizualizuje geografska područja iz vaših podataka kao poligone na mapi "
"prikazanoj uz pomoć Mapbox-a. Poligoni mogu biti obojeni na osnovu "
"metrike."

# Seeded from apache/superset@ad1abef52ee4 (reviewed upstream)
msgid ""
"Visualizes how a metric has changed over a time using a color scale and a"
" calendar view. Gray values are used to indicate missing values and the "
"linear color scheme is used to encode the magnitude of each day's value."
msgstr ""
"Vizualizuje kako se metrika menjala tokom vremena koristeći skalu boja i "
"kalendarski prikaz. Sive vrednosti označavaju vrednosti koje nedostaju, a"
" linearna šema boja se koristi za prikazivanje veličine vrednosti za "
"svaki dan."

# Seeded from apache/superset@ad1abef52ee4 (reviewed upstream)
msgid ""
"Visualizes how a single metric varies across a country's principal "
"subdivisions (states, provinces, etc) on a choropleth map. Each "
"subdivision's value is elevated when you hover over the corresponding "
"geographic boundary."
msgstr ""
"Vizualizuje kako se jedna metrika razlikuje kroz glavne administrativne "
"jedinice države (države, provincije itd.) na horoplet mapi. Vrednost "
"svake jedinice se ističe kada pređete mišem preko odgovarajuće geografske"
" granice."

# Machine-translated (Claude), needs native review
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Visualizes many different time-series objects in a single chart. This "
"chart is being deprecated and we recommend using the Time-series Chart "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"Vizualizuje mnogo različitih vremenskih serija na jednom grafikonu. Ovaj "
"grafikon je zastareo i preporučujemo da umesto njega koristite grafikon "
"vremenske serije."

# Seeded from apache/superset@ad1abef52ee4 (reviewed upstream)
msgid ""
"Visualizes the words in a column that appear the most often. Bigger font "
"corresponds to higher frequency."
msgstr ""
"Vizualizuje reči u koloni koje se najčešće pojavljuju. Veći font odgovara"
" većoj frekvenciji."

